"<i>Extended boolean</i>: <b>&lt;tag&nbsp;booleanAttr=\"1\"&gt;</b> or <b>"
"&lt;tag&nbsp;booleanAttr=\"true\"&gt;</b>.\n"
"<br>\n"
"See the <b>True</b> and <b>False</b> boxes to define the values for true and "
