msgid ""
"This is where the local part of path is specified. If a file is located on the "
"computer running Quanta at \"/home/user/htdocs/project/file.php\" and that file "
"is located on the server as \"/var/www/project/file.php\", local basedir should "
"be \"/home/user/htdocs/\" and server basedir should be \"/var/www/\".\n"
"The quanta will know that files starting with \"/home/user/project/\" on the "
"local computer, will start with \"/var/www/\" on the remote computer."
msgstr ""
"यो मार्गको स्थानीय भाग निर्दिष्ट गरिएको ठाँच हो । यदि एउटा फाइल "
"\"/home/user/htdocs/project/file.php\" मा क्वान्टा चलेको कम्प्युटरमा छ र त्यो "
"फाइल सर्भरमा \"/var/www/project/file.php\" यस रुपमा भएमा, स्थानीय basedir "
"\"/home/user/htdocs/\" हुनुपर्छ र सर्भर basedir \"/var/www/\" हुनुपर्छ ।\n"
"क्वान्टाले स्थानीय कम्प्युटरमा \"/home/user/project/\" बाट सुरु हुने फाइल, "
"टाढाको कम्प्युटरमा \"/var/www/\" बाट सुरु हुने फाइल पहिचान गर्नेछ ।"

